# Normalise line endings in the repository, leave the working copy native.
# Without this a Windows checkout rewrites every markdown file to CRLF and the
# next diff is the whole vault - which would make `git log -p` useless as a
# record of what actually changed in a note.
* text=auto

# Evidence. Kept diffable on purpose: a survey is what a clone returned on a
# date, and seeing exactly which paths appeared or vanished between cohorts is
# the point of keeping the old one.
*.json  text diff

# Not text. Marking them stops Git guessing and stops a corrupt diff attempt.
*.pdf     binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.sqlite  binary
*.canvas  text
